Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.07,0:23:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,O que a Azaka-chan disse?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.95,0:23:53.07,Sign-WinterBreak,,0,0,0,,{\c&H161410&\blur1\be0.2\fs32\fsp1\pos(648,318)\iclip(m 734 285 b 725 311 717 363 715 391 743 391 802 391 832 391 832 363 832 307 832 280)}Recesso de Inverno
