Dialogue: 10,0:23:53.82,0:23:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela está saindo de Mifune.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:56.03,0:23:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Voltando para a Reien.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:57.74,0:24:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Falou algo sobre não precisar da família para comemorar o Ano Novo.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.33,0:24:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela estava brava?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:04.00,0:24:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Estava bem irritada.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.17,0:24:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sabia.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:10.67,0:24:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Shiki, você se lembra?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.09,0:24:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Daquele gato preto.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:16.05,0:24:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquele que te pedi para cuidar durante o verão.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:19.06,0:24:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah. Aquela coisinha.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:21.14,0:24:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele acabou fugindo dos novos donos.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:24.60,0:24:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,O qu—
Dialogue: 10,0:24:25.44,0:24:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas consegui encontrá-lo.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:28.65,0:24:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Então cuidei dele por um tempo,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:32.28,0:24:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,e no fim acabou virando definitivo.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:35.62,0:24:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Achei que você não pudesse criá-lo.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:37.91,0:24:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Por isso o entreguei para os meus pais.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:42.04,0:24:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tinha razão, Shiki.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:44.75,0:24:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu o revi depois de três meses e ele ainda se lembrava de mim.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:50.67,0:24:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando o peguei no colo, ele começou a lamber meu rosto.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:59.06,0:25:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas por que um gato lamberia a sua cara?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:03.60,0:25:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez eu seja gostoso.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:11.94,0:25:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso é porque...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:17.82,0:25:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixa para lá.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:19.78,0:25:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Descubra você mesmo.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:23.50,0:25:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,T-Tudo bem.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:27.21,0:25:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Já sei.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:28.46,0:25:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Você devia ir visitá-lo, Shiki.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:31.50,0:25:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai ficar feliz em te ver.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:34.26,0:25:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Não preciso.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:35.47,0:25:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:42.10,0:25:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Já estou com você agora, então não preciso.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:54.32,0:25:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Esqueça.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:24.31,0:26:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece que superamos mais um ano.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:29.65,0:26:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,É.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:34.40,0:26:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você pediu em oração, Mikiya?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:37.90,0:26:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem, as coisas de sempre.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:41.87,0:26:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Aposto que foi algo como a paz mundial.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:45.79,0:26:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,É. Algo por aí.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:49.58,0:26:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinceramente...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:58.22,0:27:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhe, Shiki.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:07.52,0:27:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Está nevando.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:10.00,0:28:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,É melhor irmos andando.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:15.75,0:28:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiki.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:25.05,0:28:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Um brinde a mais um ano.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:35.86,0:28:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu rezo...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:40.03,0:28:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,para que você e o seu mundo sejam abençoados com a felicidade.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:01.71,0:29:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Orações são votos que preenchemos com a esperança de bênçãos para o futuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.34,0:29:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.90,0:29:26.99,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Cai serenamente,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.90,0:29:26.99,ED-Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}ふりつもるのは
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.90,0:29:26.99,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Furitsumoru no wa
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.99,0:29:33.41,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Branco e tão suave
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.99,0:29:33.41,ED-Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}白くやさしいもの
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.99,0:29:33.41,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Shiroku yasashii mono
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.41,0:29:40.04,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Tão terno quanto o tempo juntos
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.41,0:29:40.04,ED-Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}柔らかな時間
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.41,0:29:40.04,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Yawarakana jikan
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.04,0:29:47.68,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,1280)\blur0.6}Tão leve quanto os suspiros da garota
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.04,0:29:47.68,ED-Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,1280)\blur0.6}小さなためいき
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.04,0:29:47.68,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,1280)\blur0.6}Chiisana tameiki
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.56,0:29:59.81,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Perdidos num sonho,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.56,0:29:59.81,ED-Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}迷い子の夢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.56,0:29:59.81,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Mayoigo no yume
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.81,0:30:06.49,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Eles cruzam a colina
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.81,0:30:06.49,ED-Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}丘の上を渡る
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.81,0:30:06.49,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Oka no ue wo wataru
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.49,0:30:12.79,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Longe, na distância
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.49,0:30:12.79,ED-Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}遠くで呼んでる
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.49,0:30:12.79,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Tooku de yonderu
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.79,0:30:20.17,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,1080)\blur0.6}Alguém os chama com uma suave canção
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.79,0:30:20.17,ED-Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,1080)\blur0.6}静かな歌声
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.79,0:30:20.17,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,1080)\blur0.6}Shizukana utagoe
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.21,0:30:32.35,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Rumo ao lugar onde toda a vida há de chegar,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.21,0:30:32.35,ED-Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}全てのいのちが辿り着く場所へ
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.21,0:30:32.35,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Subete no inochi ga tadoritsuku basho e
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.35,0:30:36.23,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,0)\blur0.6}Juntos, de mãos dadas,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.35,0:30:36.23,ED-Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,0)\blur0.6}二人手を取って
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.35,0:30:36.23,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,0)\blur0.6}Futari te wo totte
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.23,0:30:47.20,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1280)\blur0.6}Eles apenas caminham em silêncio pela noite
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.23,0:30:47.20,ED-Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1280)\blur0.6}ただ歩いて行ける
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.23,0:30:47.20,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1280)\blur0.6}Tada aruiteyukeru
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.87,0:30:58.96,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Segredos de amor trocam entre si,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.87,0:30:58.96,ED-Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}愛をささやく
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.87,0:30:58.96,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Ai wo sasayaku
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.96,0:31:05.38,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Deixando-os transbordar dos lábios
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.96,0:31:05.38,ED-Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}くちびるに溢れる
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.96,0:31:05.38,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Kuchibiru ni koboreru
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.38,0:31:12.14,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Tão doce e nostálgico foi outrora
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.38,0:31:12.14,ED-Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}甘くなつかしい
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.38,0:31:12.14,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,480)\blur0.6}Amaku natsukashii
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.14,0:31:19.06,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,1280)\blur0.6}Quando esta história de amor começou
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.14,0:31:19.06,ED-Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,1280)\blur0.6}こいのものがたり
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.14,0:31:19.06,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,1280)\blur0.6}Koi no monogatari
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.27,0:31:33.28,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1880)\blur0.6}Cante com doçura
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.27,0:31:33.28,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1880)\blur0.6}Canta, dolce
